EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hi Team,

A new inbound lead has just been captured in Salesforce and is ready for review.

Lead Details:

Name: {!Lead.Name}
Company: {!Lead.Company}
Phone: {!Lead.Phone}
Email: {!Lead.Email}
Source: {!Lead.LeadSource}
Date Created: {!Lead.CreatedDate}

Please review and take action as soon as possible to ensure timely follow-ups.

View Lead: {!Lead.Link}

Thanks!
